  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 56 ÷ 8 × 45 + 4 − 23 = 164\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) − and ×\n\n56 ÷ 8 × 45 + 4 − 23 = 164 ⇒ 56 ÷ 8 - 45 + 4 × 23 = 164\n\n⇒ __**56 ÷ 8**__ - 45 + 4 × 23 = 164\n\n⇒ 7 - 45 + __**4 **____**×**____** 23**__ = 164\n\n⇒ __**7 + 92**__ - 45 = 164\n\n⇒ __**97 - 45**__ = 164\n\n⇒ 52 ≠ 164 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) ÷ and ×\n\n56 ÷ 8 × 45 + 4 − 23 = 164 ⇒ 56 × 8 ÷ 45 + 4 − 23 = 164\n\n⇒ 56 × __**8 **____**÷**____** 45**__ + 4 − 23 = 164\n\n⇒ __**56 × 0.17**__ + 4 − 23 = 164\n\n⇒ __**9.52**____** + 4**__ − 23 = 164\n\n⇒ __**13.52**____** − 23**__ = 164\n\n⇒ -9.48 ≠ 164 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) − and +\n\n56 ÷ 8 × 45 + 4 − 23 = 164 ⇒ 56 ÷ 8 × 45 - 4 + 23 = 164\n\n⇒ __**56 ÷ 8**__ × 45 - 4 + 23 = 164\n\n⇒ __**7 × 45**__ - 4 + 23 = 164\n\n⇒ __**315 + 23**__ - 4 = 164\n\n⇒ __**338 - 4**__ = 164\n\n⇒ 334 ≠ 164 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) + and ×\n\n56 ÷ 8 × 45 + 4 − 23 = 164 ⇒ 56 ÷ 8 + 45 × 4 − 23 = 164\n\n⇒ __**56 ÷ 8**__ + 45 × 4 − 23 = 164\n\n⇒ 7 + __**45 **____**×**____** 4**__ − 23 = 164\n\n⇒ __**7 + 180**__ − 23 = 164\n\n⇒ __**187**____** − 23**__ = 164\n\n⇒ 164 = 164 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
